# The output root is generated, but for the lockfiles of its Bun and Cargo
# workspaces, which pin the TypeScript dependencies the storefront's image
# and the checks install (D51, amended) and the Rust crates shop-stock's
# server builds with (D57). The repository's dist/ rule ignores the
# directory itself, which would hide every file under it, so it is taken
# back here and its contents ignored instead.
!/dist/
/dist/*
!/dist/bun.lock
!/dist/Cargo.lock
